Third-party notices for Salat
=============================

GeoNames city index
-------------------

The embedded city index (`salat/assets/cities.bin`, §9.2 of
`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`) is derived from GeoNames (`https://www.geonames.org`)
data, made available under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 License
(CC BY 4.0, `https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/`).

    This product includes GeoNames data.
