The index file itself is generated by `cargo run -p xtask -- gen-cities`
and lands in a later implementation phase; this notice exists from the
start so the attribution obligation is never orphaned.

AlAdhan prayer times
--------------------

Prayer times are provided by the AlAdhan API (`https://aladhan.com`),
which is the sole prayer provider for this application (§7 of
`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`).
